There's no typecheck/lint script or tsconfig in the repo. One decision not in the plan: I made the initial `lastRefill` come from `now()` at construction (rather than literal `0`), so a bucket constructed with a non-zero clock is still born full and its first `available`/`tryTake` computes a zero elapsed time. Completed on branch `feat/token-bucket` (commit `b4e1f59`).

